          "snippet": {
            "line": 68,
            "text": "theorem le_line_of_rderiv_le {v v' : ℝ → ℝ} {a b l m : ℝ}\n    (hv : ContinuousOn v (Icc a b))\n    (hv' : ∀ t ∈ Ico a b, HasDerivWithinAt v (v' t) (Ici t) t)\n    (hl : v a ≤ l) (hm : ∀ t ∈ Ico a b, v' t ≤ m) :\n    ∀ t ∈ Icc a b, v t ≤ l + m * (t - a) := by"
